      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Concrete implementations <em>may</em> throw a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/RuntimeException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>RuntimeException</code></a> if an error is encountered but are\n<em>strongly encouraged</em> to throw a specific <a href=\"ScriptException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.init\"><code>ScriptException</code></a> instead. For example, Spring's\n<a href=\"ResourceKeyspacePopulator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.init\"><code>ResourceKeyspacePopulator</code></a> wrap all exceptions in <code>ScriptExceptions</code>.",
      "translation": "具体实现<em>可能</em>在遇到错误时抛出<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/RuntimeException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>RuntimeException</code></a>，但强烈建议改为抛出特定的<a href=\"ScriptException.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.init 中的类\"><code>ScriptException</code></a>。例如，Spring 的<a href=\"ResourceKeyspacePopulator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.init 中的类\"><code>ResourceKeyspacePopulator</code></a>会将所有异常包装为<code>ScriptExceptions</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
